      &END KIND
      &KIND C
         BASIS_SET TZV2P-MOLOPT-PBE-GTH-q4
         POTENTIAL GTH-PBE-q4
      &END KIND
      &TOPOLOGY
         &CENTER_COORDINATES
         &END CENTER_COORDINATES
      &END TOPOLOGY
      &COORD
         C        1.5783799990        0.1476899992        0.3438100004
         H        1.3947499982        0.0129700011        1.4135499975
         O        1.3599300001       -1.0862000013       -0.3597800024
